{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2020-06-09 11:30:00', 'title': 'IAC ANNOUNCES AGREEMENTS TO SELL SHARES RELATING TO MATCH GROUP IN CONNECTION WITH SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP AND IAC', 'text': 'PRESS RELEASE - IAC ANNOUNCES AGREEMENTS TO SELL SHARES RELATING TO MATCH GROUP IN CONNECTION WITH SEPARATION OF MATCH GROUP AND IAC.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - AGREEMENTS WITH THIRD-PARTY INVESTORS PROVIDE FOR SALE OF ABOUT 17 MILLION SHARES OF CLASS M STOCK AT $82.00 PER SHARE.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO RESULT IN PROCEEDS OF ABOUT $1.4 BILLION.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - PURSUANT TO TRANSACTION AGREEMENT, PROCEEDS WILL BE TRANSFERRED TO NEW IAC.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - IF SALES HAVE NOT BEEN CONSUMMATED BY JULY 10, 2020, IAC OR ANY INVESTOR MAY TERMINATE PURCHASE AGREEMENTS.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - NUMBER OF OUTSTANDING SHARES OF NEW MATCH WILL NOT INCREASE AS A RESULT OF OFFERING.IAC/INTERACTIVECORP - ENTERED INTO AGREEMENTS WITH NUMBER OF THIRD-PARTY INVESTORS FOR SALE OF SHARES OF CLASS M COMMON STOCK OF IAC IN REGISTERED DIRECT PLACEMENT.IAC - AGREEMENTS WITH THIRD-PARTY INVESTORS IS EQUIVALENT OF $85.00 PER SHARE, ADJUSTED FOR $3.00 PER SHARE RELATED TO MATCH MERGER CONSIDERATION.IAC - IF SEPARATION IS COMPLETED, THERE WILL BE A SINGLE CLASS OF "ONE SHARE, ONE VOTE" COMMON STOCK OF MATCH FOLLOWING TRANSACTION.'}